Michael proclaims that this office will no longer be using any new technology of any kind because he drove his car into a lake.
迈克尔宣布办公室以后不再使用任何新技术，因为他把车开进湖里了。

1286
01:03:27.410 --> 01:03:28.270
An effing lake.
一个该死的湖。

1287
01:03:29.830 --> 01:03:32.210
Well, Oscar is like, you did what?
嗯，奥斯卡问，你做了什么？

1288
01:03:32.770 --> 01:03:36.870
And he is like, I drove my car into an effing lake.
他说，我把车开进了一个该死的湖里。

1289
01:03:38.190 --> 01:03:39.650
And they bleep it out.
然后他们把那个词消音了。

1290
01:03:39.830 --> 01:03:41.710
And this was rare.
这很罕见。

1291
01:03:41.890 --> 01:03:43.950
We did not do a lot of bleeping on our show.
我们的节目里很少用消音。

1292
01:03:44.070 --> 01:03:47.750
But every once in a while, man, it's just funnier this way.
但偶尔，伙计，这样反而更好笑。

1293
01:03:47.890 --> 01:03:48.990
It's just funnier this way.
这样确实更好笑。

1294
01:03:48.990 --> 01:03:49.410
Yeah.
是啊。

1295
01:03:49.650 --> 01:03:55.770
