And there's a very big Angela Martin eye roll at 40 minutes, 43 seconds as Michael declares himself the winner.
在40分43秒时，当迈克尔宣布自己是赢家时，安吉拉·马丁翻了一个大大的白眼。

1299
01:04:07.530 --> 01:04:09.390
But he doesn't just declare himself the winner.
但他不仅仅是宣布自己是赢家。

