01:04:09.530 --> 01:04:10.330
This is what he says.
他是这么说的。

1301
01:04:10.330 --> 01:04:19.830
To Ryan, his new boss, he says, game, set, match, point, Scott, game over, end of game.
他对新老板瑞安说，局点、盘点、赛点，斯科特，游戏结束，比赛终结。

1302
01:04:20.190 --> 01:04:22.770
And then he tries one more, but he can't think of it.
