1303
01:04:22.970 --> 01:04:24.350
So then he just walks into his office.
于是他就直接走进了办公室。

1304
01:04:26.770 --> 01:04:27.930
It's so good.
太棒了。

1305
01:04:28.310 --> 01:04:29.890
It is so good.
真是太棒了。

1306
