1319
01:05:06.990 --> 01:05:12.010
He's still gloating about his new schmancy life.
他还在为自己那奢华的新生活沾沾自喜。

1320
01:05:12.190 --> 01:05:16.810
He says, you know, he's not saying he had a meteoric rise, but, you know, but I guess
他说，你知道，他并不是说自己平步青云，但是，你知道，我想

